{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"certifiable":true,"criteria":[{"citation":{"kind":"file","line_end":157,"line_start":96,"path":"tests/unit/test_create_similar_tickets.py"},"criterion":"`rebar create` returns at most 5 similar existing tickets as an advisory field carrying id, alias, title and score. Checked by: the surfacing child's shape tests.","kind":"codebase-verifiable","met":true},{"citation":{"kind":"file","line_end":223,"line_start":129,"path":"tests/unit/test_create_similar_tickets.py"},"criterion":"That advisory is present on CLI `--output json`, the library `create_ticket` return dict, MCP `create_ticket`, and `rebar idea`. Checked by: one parity test per surface.","kind":"codebase-verifiable","met":true},{"citation":{"kind":"file","line_end":216,"line_start":145,"path":"tests/integration/test_similar_tickets_scale.py"},"criterion":"Warm-index retrieval holds a p95 below the cold-catch-up p95 divided by the recorded warm-to-cold ratio, on a synthetic store of at least 10,000 tickets, recomputing zero hashes. Checked by: a timing test asserting store size and hash count before measuring.","kind":"codebase-verifiable","met":true},{"citation":{"kind":"file","line_end":234,"line_start":229,"path":"docs/adr/0122-similar-ticket-retrieval.md"},"criterion":"The cold-catch-up p95 is measured and recorded in ADR 0122. Checked by: the ADR containing the figure.","kind":"codebase-verifiable","met":true},{"citation":{"kind":"file","line_end":366,"line_start":308,"path":"tests/integration/test_similar_tickets_scale.py"},"criterion":"After 100 creates and 100 reads against a test store, the `tickets` branch contains only user event types. Checked by: an integration test asserting the branch's event-type set.","kind":"codebase-ve